    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"miracle\" feels so exhausting though. like, if the only thing that's real is the pain, then why do we have to keep putting ourselves through the cycle? it's not like there's any reward at the end of the struggle. it just feels like we're being forced to endure something that doesn't actually have a purpose. if the end result is always just emptiness, why is the process so important to keep doing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
